        "description": "NE5532 dual op-amp as preamplifier stage. Amplifies low-level input signal with configurable gain. Uses one amplifier channel to provide gain of 100-200x overall before feeding LM386. Pin 4 (VCC_N) connects to GND, Pin 8 (VCC_P) connects to VIN_9V. Amplifier configured for single-supply operation. Input signal routed to IN1_P (Pin 3), IN1_N (Pin 2) configured for feedback/gain setting network. Output of this channel (OUT1 Pin 1) drives power amplifier input.",
